msgstr "Desno"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:237
msgid "Accent colour"
msgstr "Istaknuta boja"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:238
msgid "Consent version"
msgstr "Verzija saglasnosti"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:238
msgid "Change this value to ask every visitor for consent again."
msgstr ""
"Promenite ovu vrednost da biste od svakog posetioca ponovo zatražili "
"saglasnost."

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:239
msgid "Consent lifetime (days)"
msgstr "Trajanje saglasnosti (dani)"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:240
msgid "Google Consent Mode v2"
msgstr "Google Consent Mode v2"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:241
msgid "Allow visitors to disable the necessary category"
msgstr "Dozvoli posetiocima da isključe neophodnu kategoriju"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:242
msgid "Delete settings when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr "Obriši podešavanja kada se dodatak deinstalira"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:245
msgid "Privacy policy"
msgstr "Politika privatnosti"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:247
msgid "Serbian URL"
msgstr "URL na srpskom"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:248
msgid "English URL"
msgstr "URL na engleskom"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:251
msgid "Blocking rules"
msgstr "Pravila blokiranja"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:252
msgid ""
"Use one rule per line in the format value|category. Allowed categories: "
"necessary, preferences, analytics, marketing."
msgstr ""
"Koristite jedno pravilo po redu u formatu vrednost|kategorija. Dozvoljene "
"kategorije: necessary, preferences, analytics, marketing."

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:254
msgid "Enable URL-based script and iframe blocking"
msgstr "Omogući blokiranje skripti i iframe elemenata na osnovu URL-a"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:255
msgid "WordPress script handles"
msgstr "WordPress oznake skripti"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:256
msgid "Script URL patterns"
msgstr "URL obrasci skripti"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:257
msgid "Iframe URL patterns"
msgstr "Iframe URL obrasci"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:258
msgid "Cookies to remove after rejection"
msgstr "Kolačići za uklanjanje nakon odbijanja"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:261
msgid "Serbian Latin frontend text"
msgstr "Tekst frontenda na srpskom (latinica)"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:262
msgid "English frontend text"
msgstr "Tekst frontenda na engleskom"

#: includes/class-mbcc-settings.php:272
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Omogućeno"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "MB Cookie Scanner"
msgstr "MB skener kolačića"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Preparing the manual scan…"
msgstr "Priprema ručnog skeniranja…"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Scanned %1$d of %2$d URLs."
msgstr "Skenirano je %1$d od %2$d URL-ova."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Scan complete. Reloading results…"
msgstr "Skeniranje je završeno. Učitavanje rezultata…"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "The scan could not be completed."
msgstr "Skeniranje nije moglo biti završeno."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid ""
"Manually scan public URLs on this site for new cookie names, scripts and "
"iframes. Cookie values are never stored."
msgstr ""
"Ručno skenirajte javne URL-ove ovog sajta radi pronalaženja novih naziva "
"kolačića, skripti i iframe elemenata. Vrednosti kolačića se nikada ne "
"čuvaju."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid ""
"Suggestions are informational. Nothing is blocked and no setting is changed "
"until you confirm a category."
msgstr ""
"Predlozi su informativni. Ništa se ne blokira i nijedno podešavanje se ne "
"menja dok ne potvrdite kategoriju."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Start manual scan"
msgstr "Pokreni ručno skeniranje"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "New items requiring review"
msgstr "Nove stavke za pregled"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "No unreviewed items are currently stored."
msgstr "Trenutno nema nepregledanih stavki."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Cookie"
msgstr "Kolačić"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Script"
msgstr "Skripta"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Iframe"
msgstr "Iframe"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Neophodni"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Podešavanja"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analitika"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Marketing"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Vrsta"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Detected item"
msgstr "Otkrivena stavka"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Example page"
msgstr "Primer stranice"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Kategorija"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Radnja"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Choose category"
msgstr "Izaberite kategoriju"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Add rule"
msgstr "Dodaj pravilo"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "Ignoriši"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Clear scan history"
msgstr "Obriši istoriju skeniranja"

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid ""
"The scanner cannot guarantee discovery of HttpOnly, third-party or "
"conditionally created cookies. Review the site in a browser as part of every"
" audit."
msgstr ""
"Skener ne može garantovati otkrivanje HttpOnly, third-party ili uslovno "
"napravljenih kolačića. Pregledajte sajt u browseru kao deo svake provere."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "The scan job has expired. Start it again."
msgstr "Skeniranje je isteklo. Pokrenite ga ponovo."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Invalid cookie category."
msgstr "Nevažeća kategorija kolačića."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "The selected scan result no longer exists."
msgstr "Izabrani rezultat skeniranja više ne postoji."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "Unsupported scan result type."
msgstr "Nepodržana vrsta rezultata skeniranja."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid "You are not allowed to perform this action."
msgstr "Nemate dozvolu za ovu radnju."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Scan finished: %1$d successful, %2$d failed, %3$d total URLs."
msgstr ""
"Skeniranje završeno: %1$d uspešnih, %2$d neuspešnih, ukupno %3$d URL-ova."

#: includes/class-mbcc-scanner.php
msgid ""
"The rule could not be saved. The finding was retained; please try again."
msgstr "Pravilo nije sačuvano. Nalaz je zadržan; pokušajte ponovo."

msgid "Cookies and categories"
msgstr "Kolačići i kategorije"

msgid "Unclassified"
msgstr "Neklasifikovani"

msgid "Invalid cookie name or category."
msgstr "Neispravan naziv ili kategorija kolačića."

msgid "Settings changed. Reload the page before saving."
msgstr "Podešavanja su promenjena. Osvežite stranicu pre čuvanja."

msgid "The cookie inventory is full."
msgstr "Evidencija kolačića je popunjena."

msgid "Invalid linked rule."
msgstr "Neispravno povezano pravilo."

msgid ""
"A configured rule requires a category. Remove the rule in Settings to leave "
"it unclassified."
msgstr ""
"Podešeno pravilo zahteva kategoriju. Uklonite pravilo u Podešavanjima da "
"stavka ostane nekategorisana."

msgid ""
"Overlapping cookie patterns use different categories. Resolve them in "
"Settings before moving this cookie."
msgstr ""
"Obrasci koji se preklapaju koriste različite kategorije. Uskladite ih u "
"Podešavanjima pre premeštanja kolačića."

msgid "The rule could not be saved. Please try again."
msgstr "Pravilo nije sačuvano. Pokušajte ponovo."

msgid ""
"The record could not be saved. Review Settings before retrying; a rule "
"change may already have been saved."
msgstr ""
"Zapis nije sačuvan. Pregledajte Podešavanja pre ponovnog pokušaja; promena "
"pravila je možda već sačuvana."

msgid ""
"Recorded cookies and configured patterns, not a live browser cookie list. "
"Cookie values are never stored. A category change does not change the "
"category of a linked script or service."
msgstr ""
"Evidentirani kolačići i podešeni obrasci, a ne živa lista kolačića iz "
"pregledača. Vrednosti kolačića se ne čuvaju. Promena kategorije ne menja "
"kategoriju povezane skripte ili servisa."

msgid ""
"Server control required: server and HttpOnly records are informational only."
" Their category does not block or delete them. Existing removal rules remain"
" visible in Settings."
msgstr ""
"Serverska kontrola potrebna: serverski i HttpOnly zapisi su samo "
"informativni. Njihova kategorija ih ne blokira niti briše. Postojeća pravila"
" uklanjanja ostaju vidljiva u Podešavanjima."

msgid "Cookie / pattern"
msgstr "Kolačić / obrazac"

msgid "Service / domain"
msgstr "Servis / domen"

msgid "Related rule / source"
msgstr "Povezano pravilo / izvor"

msgid "Server control required"
msgstr "Serverska kontrola potrebna"

msgid "Required to remember consent"
msgstr "Obavezan za pamćenje saglasnosti"

msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Izmeni"

msgid "No recorded cookies in this category."
msgstr "Nema evidentiranih kolačića u ovoj kategoriji."

msgid "Add cookie record"
msgstr "Dodaj zapis kolačića"

msgid "Review blocking rules and Consent version in Settings."
msgstr "Pregledajte pravila blokiranja i Verziju saglasnosti u Podešavanjima."

msgid "Service"
msgstr "Servis"

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "Domen"

msgid "Server-set cookie (record only)"
msgstr "Serverski kolačić (samo evidencija)"

msgid "Linked script / iframe rule (optional)"
msgstr "Povezano pravilo skripte / iframe-a (opciono)"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Nema"

msgid "This edit updates the matching pattern for every cookie it covers:"
msgstr "Ova izmena menja odgovarajući obrazac za svaki kolačić koji obuhvata:"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Sačuvaj"

msgid "Save record"
msgstr "Sačuvaj zapis"

msgid "The record could not be saved. Please try again."
msgstr "Zapis nije sačuvan. Pokušajte ponovo."

msgid "The cookie inventory is full. Some cookies could not be recorded; scanning continued. Review the scan findings."
msgstr "Evidencija kolačića je popunjena. Neki kolačići nisu evidentirani; skeniranje je nastavljeno. Pregledajte rezultate skeniranja."

msgid "Some cookie inventory records could not be saved. Scanning continued; review the findings and retry."
msgstr "Neki zapisi kolačića nisu sačuvani. Skeniranje je nastavljeno; pregledajte rezultate i pokušajte ponovo."

msgid "A rule value cannot contain a pipe (|) or a line break. The finding was retained."
msgstr "Vrednost pravila ne može sadržati znak | ili novi red. Nalaz je zadržan."
